<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/hasProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a scientific subject to a property established for its stated scope. A topical assertion about that subject does not propagate to narrower SKOS concepts."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/hasProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/hasProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has property"@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/hasProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/recognizesExactly> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/recognizesExactly> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a machine model to the family consisting of the languages recognized by machines of that model. Each machine recognizes an individual language. The assertion has no symmetry or transitive closure."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/recognizesExactly> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/recognizesExactly> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "recognizes exactly"@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/recognizesExactly> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/represents> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/represents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a representation to a structure or family of structures it can encode. Multiple representations may encode the same structure."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/represents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/represents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "represents"@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/represents> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a method to an input condition assumed in the stated standard application or guarantee. A violation removes that guarantee and need not make every run fail."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "requires assumption"@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/requiresAssumption> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From an algorithm to the problem it solves under its applicability conditions. Does not imply every instance satisfies those conditions."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "solves"@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/solves> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/uses> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/uses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "From a method or construct to a mathematical or computational ingredient it employs. Directional; no closure rule."@en .
<https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/uses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
